Package: openmediavault-qnap-ts219p
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: laserbirdx <https://github.com/laserbirdx>
Depends: openmediavault (>= 7.0), python3, qcontrol, smartmontools, ethtool
Recommends: qnap-ts219p-boot
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/laserbirdx/qnap-ts-219p-omv
Description: OpenMediaVault 7 hardware plugins for the QNAP TS-219P II (Kirkwood 88F6282)
 Native OMV 7 plugins for the QNAP TS-219P II (Marvell Kirkwood 88F6282):
  - Fan & Thermal: PIC16F smart fan curve & manual control (silence/low/med/high/full)
  - LED & Night Mode: Status bi-color LED, USB LED, presets, hourly sleep schedule
  - Chassis Buttons: short/long press actions for Front USB Copy and Rear Reset
  - One-Touch USB Backup with folder naming, buzzer/LED feedback and post-actions
  - Interactive "Hardware Overview" dashboard widget (front/rear chassis)
 English and Turkish (tr_TR) translations included.
